@startuml
title 图3-2 出场结算进程视图（服务级，AI-辅助）
autonumber
actor 车主
participant "客户端" as client
participant "gateway" as gateway
participant "access-service" as access
participant "pass-service" as pass
participant "space-service" as space
participant "billing-service" as billing

车主 -> client : 申请出场(exitTime, exceptionType)
client -> gateway : POST exit-requests + Idempotency-Key
gateway -> access : 转发同一请求键
activate access
access -> pass : 核验预约/月卡权益
pass --> access : 权益与预付快照
access -> space : settlement(sessionId, 幂等键)
space --> access : 冻结后的充电费用快照
note over access : 本地事务保存 exit_intent；\n停车记录转 EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT
access -> billing : createBill(sessionId, 快照, 幂等键)
alt billing 暂不可用
  billing --> access : 调用失败
  access --> gateway : 503 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE
  gateway --> client : 提示稍后重试
  client -> gateway : 同请求键、同内容重试
  gateway -> access : 恢复原出场请求
  note over access : 读取原 exit_intent；\n不重新计算权益或新建出场意图
  access -> space : settlement(sessionId, 原幂等键)
  space --> access : 原冻结费用快照
  access -> billing : createBill(sessionId, 原快照, 同一账单幂等键)
  note over billing : parkingSessionId 唯一约束；\n重试只返回同一张账单
end
billing --> access : billId、应付金额
access -> access : 保存 billId，仍为 EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT
access --> gateway : 账单摘要
gateway --> client : 展示待支付账单
deactivate access

车主 -> client : 完成出场(SUCCESS)
client -> gateway : POST complete-exit + Idempotency-Key
gateway -> access : 转发同一请求键
activate access
access -> billing : 查询账单支付状态
billing --> access : UNPAID / PAID
opt 月卡余额足够且账单未付
  access -> pass : deduct(sessionId, 金额, 幂等键)
  pass --> access : 扣费流水 / 余额不足则改模拟支付
end
opt 账单未付
  access -> billing : pay(billId, 模拟结果/余额来源, 幂等键)
  billing --> access : 支付结果；重试不重复成功扣费
end
alt 支付成功
  access -> access : 本地状态 PAID_PENDING_RELEASE
  opt 预约预付款有待退差额
    access -> pass : refund-remainder(sessionId, 幂等键)
    pass --> access : 原退款结果
  end
  access -> space : release(spaceId, sessionId, 幂等键)
  alt 释放成功
    space --> access : AVAILABLE
    access -> access : 本地状态 CLOSED
    access --> gateway : CLOSED
  else 释放暂失败
    space --> access : 调用失败
    access --> gateway : PAID_PENDING_RELEASE
    note over access,space : 同请求键重试仅重做退款/释放；\n跳过已成功支付，不二次扣费
  end
else 支付失败
  access --> gateway : EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT
end
gateway --> client : 展示最终或待恢复状态
deactivate access
@enduml
